Subject: [PATCH 4.19 168/187] media: s5p-jpeg: Check for fmt_ver_flag when doing fmt enumeration
Date:   Thu,  4 Apr 2019 10:48:25 +0200
Message-Id: <20190404084611.001891681@linuxfoundation.org>
